16:31.330 --> 16:35.494
I'm looking for a car that's been
tricked out to look like an ice-cream truck.

16:35.601 --> 16:37.262
Damn it! I'm sorry, what?

16:37.369 --> 16:40.804
You know, with colorfuI pictures
of ice cream treats.

16:40.972 --> 16:44.065
And it plays a tune
that's fun for the young children.

16:58.254 --> 16:59.881
Okay, I'm going out.

16:59.987 --> 17:03.446
- Where are you going?
- To my garden club.

17:03.557 --> 17:06.287
It's 10:30 at night and you have a saddle.

17:06.426 --> 17:07.394
Well, it's a...

17:10.930 --> 17:14.888
What's this? What's this, Brian, huh?
What's this, huh?

17:15.000 --> 17:16.900
- It's a ball.
- Oh, is this your ball?

17:17.036 --> 17:18.831
You want it, huh? You want this, huh?

17:18.937 --> 17:20.837
Yes, I would like it, please, yes.

17:20.938 --> 17:22.496
You want this, huh? You want the ball?

17:22.606 --> 17:25.404
- Yes, I would like to have it very much.
- You want the ball?

17:25.509 --> 17:27.204
I would enjoy having it, yes. Give it to me.

17:27.310 --> 17:28.334
Go, get it.

17:29.946 --> 17:33.211
I'm sorry, Lois, I was mistaken.
I thought you threw the ball in there...

17:33.315 --> 17:34.613
but I can see now you still have it.

17:34.717 --> 17:35.741
Go, get the ball.

17:38.220 --> 17:39.743
I say, are you blind, or just stupid?

17:39.854 --> 17:41.583
- What do you mean?
- Perhaps you'd like to see...

17:41.756 --> 17:44.384
what Lois and the fat man have been up to
in your absence.

17:47.427 --> 17:51.260
Hello, MTV, I think
I would be perfect for The ReaI World.

17:51.665 --> 17:55.997
Because I speak my mind
and not everyone likes that.

17:57.235 --> 18:01.433
But I'm not afraid to go there.
And I can be sexy.

18:03.874 --> 18:06.570
Look at my fanny, look at my fanny,
look at my fanny.

18:06.678 --> 18:09.168
- Wow, I can't believe they didn't take you.
- Shut up!

18:09.313 --> 18:10.643
all right, here it is.

18:12.816 --> 18:13.840
Oh Peter.

18:17.587 --> 18:18.575
Hang on.

18:19.788 --> 18:21.653
Shazzam!

18:23.358 --> 18:24.984
Good for you.

18:25.159 --> 18:27.787
My God. How could they do this to me?

18:42.973 --> 18:45.840
Peter, I can't keep
sneaking around with you like this.

18:45.943 --> 18:49.901
- See, it's not fair to Brian.
- What about me, Lois. I love you, too.

18:50.014 --> 18:53.504
And the other thing is, Lois, hi, he's a dog.

18:53.617 --> 18:56.550
Please. Please don't make this any harder
than it has to be.

18:56.685 --> 19:00.620
You know, I will always love you,
but I made a commitment to Brian.

19:00.956 --> 19:03.946
I can never repay him
for what he's done for this family.

19:04.559 --> 19:06.186
I'm sorry, Peter.

19:10.697 --> 19:12.687
all right, Simon, do your worst.

19:14.934 --> 19:17.232
I find it's easy
if I make it into a little song.

19:17.403 --> 19:20.963
Red, green, blue, green, blue, blue
Then you put in words

19:21.207 --> 19:24.403
I like tea and cakes for tea and cake time

19:25.609 --> 19:28.544
- Brian, you're still up.
