- You're a good friend too, Lois.

20:10.447 --> 20:11.573
That's kind of nice.

20:14.484 --> 20:16.975
Well, thank God,
everything's back to normaI.

20:17.087 --> 20:18.110
I'll say.

20:18.221 --> 20:21.883
And to think, Brian, I was, like,
