20:22.190 --> 20:24.090
I was gonna push those beds together...

20:24.192 --> 20:26.854
and take you
around the freaking world, Brian.

20:27.695 --> 20:30.323
But a nice pat on the head
is just as good, huh?

20:30.898 --> 20:34.265
- You want your ball?
- No, Lois, I don't want the ball right now.

20:34.501 --> 20:35.468
I'll be in the basement.

20:35.568 --> 20:37.058
- Doing what?
- What do you think?

20:42.508 --> 20:44.771
Okay, somebody's gonna have to
explain that to me.

20:44.772 --> 21:45.772
Thank you for watching «Family Guy» on
www.FOX-fan.ru